  "text": "Recipe: Corn Bowls\nCreator: Mrs N K Manku\nCategory: Bowls\nIngredients: corn flour, flaxseed powder, rolled oats, chia seed powder, cinnamon powder, cardamom powder\nCooking methods: bake\nInstructions: Prepare firm dough by combining all ingredients with some warm water.\nMake small balls out of it. Flatten them and press into them with our thumb to shape them into small bowls.\nBake both sides at 180 C for 15 minutes and 10 minutes, respectively, flipping in between.\nNotes: A recipe with WHOLE GRAINS (corn flour, rolled oats), NUTS & SEEDS (flaxseed powder, chia seed powder), HERBS & SPICES (cinnamon powder, cardamom powder). SAVORY MUFFINS & CUPCAKES",
